iven options, and "0" is not available, I will select the option that most closely matches the evidence of no hostesses being present.\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "FINAL_ANSWER",\n    "frames": [\n        "frames/frame_0038.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0039.jpg", \n        "frames/frame_0040.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0054.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0057.jpg"\n    ],\n    "answer": "0",\n    "reasoning": "Based on VLM analysis of multiple frames throughout the Nobel Prize Award Ceremony, no hostesses are visible. All women observed are attendees, dignitaries, or laureates wearing distinct formal attire with no uniformity or positioning that suggests hosting duties. They are not positioned near entrances or aisles, not wearing uniform attire, and not performing any hosting functions like guiding guests or handing out programs.",\n    "answer_criteria": [\n        "No women are observed in uniform attire that would indicate hostess roles",\n        "No women are positioned at entrances, aisles, or in welcoming/guiding positions",\n        "No women are performing hosting duties such as assisting guests or directing movement"\n    ]\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': '📋 CRITIC FEEDBACK (Confidence: 33%)'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": [\n        "frames/frame_0033.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0034.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0035.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0036.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0037.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0038.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0039.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0040.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0041.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0042.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0043.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0044.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0045.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0049.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0050.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0051.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0052.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0053.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0054.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0055.jpg",\n        